+    /**
+     * Device-local D-pad verification (ported from Nuvio-KE). The verdict reads the store fresh
+     * via first() — the dpadUnlockState StateFlow can still hold its empty initial value, which
+     * would spuriously fail. The enabled gate lives at the screen (single caller); this checks
